{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>Broom Broom Karts</strong> \u2013 Fast, Fun &amp; Furry Racing Mayhem! \ud83d\ude97\ud83d\udca8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to drift, boost, and <strong>BROOM BROOM</strong> your way to victory in this fast-paced, cartoonish kart racer! Pick your favorite animal racer and battle it out across four thrilling tracks \u2013 from <strong>Wild West deserts</strong> to <strong>frozen winter wonderlands, magical fairytale roads,</strong> and <strong>tropical island escapes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Arcade Racing at Its Best!</strong><br>\u2705 <strong>Multiplayer Madness</strong> \u2013 Race against friends or foes in high-speed, action-packed showdowns!<br>\u2705 <strong>Boost, Drift &amp; Fly</strong> \u2013 Hit speed boosts, soar over ramps, and master the tracks!<br>\u2705 <strong>4 Unique Tracks</strong> \u2013 Each packed with shortcuts, hazards, and surprises.<br>\u2705 <strong>Adorable &amp; Fierce Racers</strong> \u2013 Choose from a lineup of fast and furry characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Coming Soon:</strong> Special character abilities, power-ups, and even more wild tracks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're racing solo or going wheel-to-wheel with friends, <strong>Broom Broom Karts</strong> is the ultimate <strong>low-poly, high-fun</strong> kart racing experience. Buckle up, hit the gas, and let's GO!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3365990?t=1744659274","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3365990?t=1744659274","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365990/643f5ea6cbc5f3290526c2a9f274eb3a02a3f616/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744659274","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365990/643f5ea6cbc5f3290526c2a9f274eb3a02a3f616/ca